# octo-feather skill management.
#
# skillfile (github.com/eljulians/skillfile) pins upstream skills at exact SHAs
# and preserves the tdd seam-gate patch across upstream updates
# (.skillfile/patches). Every kit skill, vendored or local, lives in .agents/skills
# (the Agent Skills convention, docs/adr/0018) and is committed. pi-role passes
# each role's listed skills with --skill and turns discovery off, so nothing is
# installed into the user's Pi profile.
#
# Never run `skillfile install` in the repo: it rewrites the patches and strips
# their reason lines. `just check-vendored` (in `just check`, offline) runs the
# pinned skillfile in a throwaway copy and fails when a committed folder drifts
# from pin plus patches; `just vendored-fetch` fills its cache (once per pin).

install-path  octo-feather  skill  .agents/skills

